{"id":"40e006651d608f40","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Convergence In Probability","display":"df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability — ZFC Prob4 Convergence In Probability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability — ZFC Prob4 Convergence In Probability","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-borel]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-convergence-in-probability — ZFC Prob4 Convergence In Probability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8902399f82dbe8a2\" href=\"?note=8902399f82dbe8a2\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" href=\"?note=d4d304b0bbb11c1a\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space\">58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> is the usual topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}=\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> is its Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9375de7089953a2b\" href=\"?note=9375de7089953a2b\" title=\"58-df-borel\">58-df-borel</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ConvergenceInProbability}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4ConvergenceInProbability}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}real\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}real\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}real\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}real\\text{-}borel}\\vdash\n\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R}\\coloneqq\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R,\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}probability} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb4ConvergenceInProbability}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid|\\vec X(n)(\\xi)-X(\\xi)|&gt;\\varepsilon\\})&lt;\\delta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}convergence\\text{-}in\\text{-}probability} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcProb4ConvergenceInProbability}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcProbProbabilitySpace}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(X,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\mathrm{ZfcProbRandomVariable}_S(\\vec X(n),\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb R,\\mathcal B_{\\mathbb R})\\land\\forall\\varepsilon,\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(N\\leq n\\to\\mathbb P(\\{\\xi\\in\\Omega\\mid|\\vec X(n)(\\xi)-X(\\xi)|&gt;\\varepsilon\\})&lt;\\delta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The epsilon-delta tail condition is stated for real random variables on a specified probability space.  Their target measurable space is now the Borel space generated by the explicitly fixed usual topology, not an undeclared one-argument <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-borel]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8902399f82dbe8a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"d4d304b0bbb11c1a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-borel","status":"resolved","id":"9375de7089953a2b","anchor":"ref-5","targetA